# PdfUnlocker password list
#
# Add the passwords PdfUnlocker should try below this comment block, one per
# line, then save this file. They are tried in order, top to bottom.
#
# Rules:
#   - Blank lines and lines starting with '#' are ignored.
#   - IMPORTANT: passwords are NOT trimmed. Leading and trailing spaces are kept
#     exactly as written, because they may be a real part of the password.
#
# Examples (delete the leading "# " to use one):
# MyFirstPassword
# 1985-07-23
# correct horse battery staple

